+| `TF_GLM_OVN_DRAFT_ONEPASS` | Exactly `0` or `1`; default off (a DFlash2 pass's 4-bit linears in launches of q4.many_rows rows) |
+| `TF_GLM_OVN_DRAFT_DOWN4` | Exactly `0` or `1`; default off (the drafter MLP's down at 4 bits) |
+| `TF_GLM_OVN_DRAFT_KEEPWIN` | Exactly `0` or `1`; default off (kept prompt states carry the drafter's window rows) |
+| `TF_GLM_OVN_DRAFT_MLPSPLIT` | Whole stream count; at world 3 or more the drafter MLP is split over the ranks while at most this many streams are in a pass; default 0 (off) |
+| `TF_GLM_OVN_DRAFT_EDGE` | Finite number, the DFlash2 selector's edge weight in a pick; default 1 |
+| `TF_GLM_OVN_DRAFT_BETA` | Finite number above 0; set, the drafts' chances are softmax((score + noise) / beta); default unset |
+| `TF_GLM_OVN_DRAFT_NOISE` | Finite number of at least 0, the keyed Gumbel draw's weight in a sampled stream's pick; default 0 (off) |
+| `TF_GLM_OVN_DRAFT_CUTS` | Comma-separated `streams:cut` pairs (`1:0.3,4:0.7`): a pass of N streams takes the cut of the largest key at most N, else `TF_GLM_DRAFT_CONFIDENCE`; checked as text at startup and as pairs when the drafter loads; default unset |
+| `TF_GLM_DFLASH2_WIN` | Whole count from 0 through 2048 of the context positions a DFlash2 draft attends to; drafts only, never replies; default 2048 |
 | `TF_PROMPT_ROWS` | Native serving: a multiple of 16 from 128 through 2048; unset keeps the chip/family default |
 | `TF_ANE_COLUMNS` | Whole u32 count; zero disables the experimental share; default zero |
 | `TF_FLASHNEXT_SCALE_INDEX` | Flash Next on Metal before tensor units: exactly `0` or `1`; `1` has the 4-bit expert kernels read each group's scale and bias through a 16-bit index into its tensor's table of pairs, the same values with fewer weight bytes; default 0 |
